    "4. Legal basis": "4. Legal basis",
    "Processing is based on contract performance, legal obligations, legitimate interests for service security and consent where consent is requested.": "Processing is based on contract performance, legal obligations, legitimate interests for service security and consent where consent is requested.",
    "5. EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR)": "5. EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR)",
    "Maskines processes personal data according to GDPR principles: lawfully, fairly, transparently and only for defined purposes.": "Maskines processes personal data according to GDPR principles: lawfully, fairly, transparently and only for defined purposes.",
    "6. Retention": "6. Retention",
    "Account data is kept while the account exists. After deletion, data is removed or anonymised within a reasonable time unless law, disputes or misuse investigations require longer retention.": "Account data is kept while the account exists. After deletion, data is removed or anonymised within a reasonable time unless law, disputes or misuse investigations require longer retention.",
    "7. Recipients and transfers": "7. Recipients and transfers",
